# Issue RP-2 Add headFile() and indexFile()

## Goal

Return the locations of the two MiniGit control files.

## Dependency

RP-1 merged.

## Functions to add

- `std::filesystem::path headFile() const;` returns `metadataRoot_ / "HEAD"`
- `std::filesystem::path indexFile() const;` returns `metadataRoot_ / "index.txt"`

## Acceptance criteria

- Both functions build on `metadataRoot_`, not on `projectRoot_` plus a typed `.minigit`.
- Neither function reads or creates the file.
- Local CTest and Windows/Ubuntu CI pass.

## Tests to write

- For an ordinary and a nested root, compare each result with `root / ".minigit" / "HEAD"` and `root / ".minigit" / "index.txt"`.
- `headFile().parent_path()` equals `metadataRoot()`.
- `indexFile().filename()` equals `"index.txt"`.

## Out of scope

Writing HEAD or the index; stage and commit locations.

## Reviewer focus

Is `"HEAD"` written without a slash? (`metadataRoot_ / "/HEAD"` silently returns `/HEAD`.)
